      "id": "hub",
      "text": "Rule of the yard: beasts fed first. Bins are low. Five sheaves of wheat, Garton's counter or the field, and while they eat I'll show you what a stable's actually for. No, not you. The tall one. Yes.",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "kind": "quest_offer",
          "quest": "a_stall_swept_clean"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll fill the bins.",
          "next": "sworn"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm no stable hand.",
          "next": "declined"
        }
      ],
      "voice": "q_a_stall_swept_clean_offer__hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "sworn",
      "text": "Good answer. The grey thinks so too. He's a fine judge and a terrible horse.",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "kind": "quest_accept",
          "quest": "a_stall_swept_clean"
        }
      ],
      "voice": "q_a_stall_swept_clean_offer__sworn"
    },
    {
      "id": "declined",
      "text": "Nobody is, until a road gets long enough. It always does.",
      "voice": "q_a_stall_swept_clean_offer__declined"
    }
  ]
